================================================================================
第三部分: 函数调用关系 (Function Call Relations)
================================================================================

1. 求解流程调用链
   ============================================
   
   1.1 主要求解流程:
      MainSolver::check()
        -> LASolver::check(bool complete)
          -> LASolver::check_simplex(bool complete)
            -> Simplex::checkSimplex()
              -> [主循环]
                -> Simplex::getBasicVarToFixByShortestPoly() 或
                   Simplex::getBasicVarToFixByBland()
                -> Simplex::findNonBasicForPivotByHeuristic() 或
                   Simplex::findNonBasicForPivotByBland()
                -> Simplex::pivot(LVRef basic, LVRef nonBasic)
                  -> Tableau::pivot(LVRef bv, LVRef nv)
                  -> Simplex::updateValues(LVRef basicVar, LVRef nonBasicVar)
                -> LRAModel::saveAssignment() [如果SAT]
                -> Simplex::getConflictingBounds() [如果UNSAT]
   
   1.2 约束断言流程:
      MainSolver::insertFormula(PTRef)
        -> LASolver::declareAtom(PTRef)
          -> LASolver::addBound(PTRef leq_tr)
            -> LASolver::getVarForTerm(PTRef)
            -> LASolver::getBoundsValue(LVRef, Real, bool)
            -> LABoundStore::allocBoundPair()
      
      MainSolver::assertLit(PtAsgn)
        -> LASolver::assertLit(PtAsgn)
          -> LASolver::assertBound(LABoundRef)
            -> Simplex::assertBound(LABoundRef)
              -> LRAModel::pushBound(LABoundRef)
              -> Simplex::quasiToBasic(LVRef) [如果需要]
              -> Simplex::checkSimplex() [如果违反边界]

2. 变量和表达式处理调用链
   ============================================
   
   2.1 变量注册流程:
      LASolver::registerArithmeticTerm(PTRef expr)
        -> LASolver::getLAVar_single(PTRef)
          -> LAVarMapper::hasVar(PTRef)
          -> LAVarStore::getNewVar()
          -> LAVarMapper::registerNewMapping(LVRef, PTRef)
        -> [递归处理子项]
   
   2.2 表达式转换流程:
      LASolver::expressionToLVarPoly(PTRef term)
        -> ArithLogic::splitTermToVarAndConst(PTRef)
        -> LASolver::getLAVar_single(PTRef)
        -> Tableau::Polynomial::addTerm(LVRef, Real)
   
   2.3 表初始化流程:
      Simplex::newRow(LVRef x, std::unique_ptr<Polynomial> poly)
        -> Tableau::newRow(LVRef v, std::unique_ptr<Polynomial> poly)
          -> Tableau::addRow(LVRef v, std::unique_ptr<Polynomial> p)
          -> Tableau::normalizeRow(LVRef row)
        -> Simplex::newVar(LVRef v)
          -> LRAModel::addVar(LVRef v)
          -> LABoundStore::ensureReadyFor(LVRef v)

3. 边界管理调用链
   ============================================
   
   3.1 边界分配流程:
      LABoundStore::allocBoundPair(LVRef v, BoundValuePair)
        -> LABoundAllocator::alloc(BoundT, LVRef, Delta)
        -> bounds[getVarId(v)].push(LABoundRef)
   
   3.2 边界激活流程:
      Simplex::assertBound(LABoundRef boundRef)
        -> LRAModel::pushBound(LABoundRef br)
          -> int_lbounds[getVarId(v)].push(br) 或
             int_ubounds[getVarId(v)].push(br)
        -> Simplex::boundActivated(LVRef v)
          -> Simplex::quasiToBasic(LVRef) [如果是quasi-basic]
          -> boundsActivated[getVarId(v)]++
   
   3.3 边界检查流程:
      Simplex::isModelOutOfBounds(LVRef v)
        -> Simplex::isModelOutOfUpperBound(LVRef v)
          -> LRAModel::hasUBound(LVRef v)
          -> LRAModel::read(LVRef v) > LRAModel::Ub(LVRef v)
        -> Simplex::isModelOutOfLowerBound(LVRef v)
          -> LRAModel::hasLBound(LVRef v)
          -> LRAModel::read(LVRef v) < LRAModel::Lb(LVRef v)

4. 旋转操作调用链
   ============================================
   
   4.1 旋转执行流程:
      Simplex::pivot(LVRef basic, LVRef nonBasic)
        -> Tableau::pivot(LVRef bv, LVRef nv)
          -> Tableau::getRowPoly(LVRef basicVar)
          -> Tableau::Polynomial::removeVar(LVRef var)
          -> Tableau::Polynomial::divideBy(Real c)
          -> Tableau::Polynomial::negate()
          -> Tableau::Polynomial::addTerm(LVRef, Real)
          -> Tableau::moveRowFromTo(LVRef from, LVRef to)
          -> Tableau::moveColFromTo(LVRef from, LVRef to)
          -> [更新所有包含nonBasic的行]
            -> Tableau::getColumn(LVRef nonBasicVar)
            -> Tableau::getRowPoly(LVRef rowVar)
            -> Tableau::Polynomial::substitute(LVRef oldVar, Polynomial& newPoly)
        -> Simplex::updateValues(LVRef basicVar, LVRef nonBasicVar)
          -> LRAModel::read(LVRef v) [读取非基本变量值]
          -> [计算基本变量新值]
          -> LRAModel::write(LVRef v, Delta) [写入新值]
          -> Simplex::isModelOutOfBounds(LVRef v) [检查是否违反边界]
          -> Simplex::newCandidate(LVRef) [如果违反]
          -> Simplex::eraseCandidate(LVRef) [如果满足]

5. 模型更新调用链
   ============================================
   
   5.1 赋值更新流程:
      LRAModel::write(const LVRef &v, Delta value)
        -> current_assignment[getVarId(v)] = value
        -> changed_vars_set.add(getVarId(v))
        -> changed_vars_vec.push(v) [如果未在集合中]
   
   5.2 赋值保存流程:
      LRAModel::saveAssignment()
        -> [遍历changed_vars_vec]
          -> last_consistent_assignment[getVarId(v)] = current_assignment[getVarId(v)]
        -> changed_vars_vec.clear()
        -> changed_vars_set.reset()
   
   5.3 赋值恢复流程:
      LRAModel::restoreAssignment()
        -> [遍历changed_vars_vec]
          -> current_assignment[getVarId(v)] = last_consistent_assignment[getVarId(v)]
        -> changed_vars_vec.clear()
        -> changed_vars_set.reset()

6. 回溯调用链
   ============================================
   
   6.1 回溯点创建:
      LASolver::pushBacktrackPoint()
        -> Simplex::pushBacktrackPoint()
          -> LRAModel::pushBacktrackPoint()
            -> bound_limits.push(bound_trace.size())
   
   6.2 回溯执行:
      LASolver::popBacktrackPoint()
        -> Simplex::popBacktrackPoint()
          -> LRAModel::popBacktrackPoint()
            -> LRAModel::popBounds()
              -> [恢复边界栈到上一个回溯点]
          -> Simplex::finalizeBacktracking()
            -> candidates.clear()
            -> bufferOfActivatedBounds.clear()

7. 冲突解释生成调用链
   ============================================
   
   7.1 冲突检测:
      Simplex::checkSimplex()
        -> [找不到可旋转的非基本变量]
        -> Simplex::getConflictingBounds(LVRef x, bool conflictOnLower)
          -> LRAModel::readLBoundRef(LVRef v) 或
             LRAModel::readUBoundRef(LVRef v)
          -> [构建Farkas解释]
            -> Explanation.push_back({LABoundRef, Real coeff})
   
   7.2 解释存储:
      LASolver::storeExplanation(Simplex::Explanation &&)
        -> [遍历explanation]
          -> LASolver::getAsgnByBound(LABoundRef)
          -> explanation.push(PtAsgn)
          -> explanationCoefficients.push_back(Real)

8. 初始化调用链
   ============================================
   
   8.1 求解器初始化:
      LASolver::initSolver()
        -> LABoundStore::buildBounds()
          -> [为每个变量构建边界列表]
        -> [初始化Simplex]
          -> Simplex::initModel()
            -> LRAModel::init()

9. 多项式操作调用链
   ============================================
   
   9.1 多项式构建:
      Tableau::Polynomial::addTerm(LVRef var, Real coeff)
        -> [查找或插入项]
          -> poly_t::insert() 或 poly_t::update()
   
   9.2 多项式规范化:
      Tableau::normalizeRow(LVRef row)
        -> Tableau::getRowPoly(LVRef row)
        -> Tableau::Polynomial::getCoeff(LVRef basicVar)
        -> Tableau::Polynomial::divideBy(Real c)
   
   9.3 变量替换:
      Tableau::Polynomial::substitute(LVRef oldVar, Polynomial& newPoly)
        -> Tableau::Polynomial::getCoeff(LVRef oldVar)
        -> [对newPoly的每一项]
          -> Tableau::Polynomial::addTerm(LVRef var, Real coeff)

10. 关键算法模式
   ============================================
   
   10.1 单纯形算法主循环模式:
      while (true) {
        x = selectBasicVarToFix();  // 选择违反边界的基本变量
        if (x == Undef) return SAT;  // 没有违反，返回SAT
        
        y = findNonBasicForPivot(x); // 寻找旋转变量
        if (y == Undef) return UNSAT; // 找不到，返回UNSAT
        
        pivot(x, y);  // 执行旋转
        updateValues();  // 更新值
      }
   
   10.2 边界激活模式:
      assertBound(boundRef) {
        pushBound(boundRef);  // 推入边界栈
        if (isQuasiBasic(var)) quasiToBasic(var);  // 转换类型
        if (violatesBound(var)) {
          addToCandidates(var);  // 加入候选
          checkSimplex();  // 触发检查
        }
      }
   
   10.3 旋转更新模式:
      pivot(basic, nonBasic) {
        updateTableau(basic, nonBasic);  // 更新表结构
        updateValues(basic, nonBasic);  // 更新模型值
        updateCandidates();  // 更新候选集合
        updateColumns();  // 更新列索引
      }

================================================================================
算法总结
================================================================================

OpenSMT的LRA求解器实现了基于单纯形法的线性实数算术求解算法。主要特点：

1. 算法: Dantzig单纯形法 + Bland规则（避免循环）
2. 数据结构: 稀疏表表示 + 增量模型更新
3. 边界管理: 栈式回溯 + 边界激活机制
4. 变量管理: PTRef到LVRef的双向映射
5. 冲突解释: Farkas引理生成最小冲突集

关键优化：
- 最短多项式启发式选择基本变量
- 更独立变量优先的旋转选择
- 增量赋值更新（只跟踪更改的变量）
- Quasi-basic变量延迟激活机制

